# --- Local certificates for the https dev server (never commit keys) ---
SplatWalk/cert.pem
SplatWalk/key.pem

# --- Splat data ---
# Training PLYs run to hundreds of MB and change on every retrain, so the folder
# is ignored by default. Prepared scenes you want reachable from the Pages site
# are the exception and are whitelisted one by one below.
#
# They have to be committed rather than attached to a Release: Release assets are
# NOT CORS-enabled (no access-control-allow-origin, and OPTIONS returns 405), so
# a browser on kumodot.github.io cannot fetch one. A committed file is served by
# Pages from the same origin as the app, so no CORS is involved at all.
# Keep each one under 100 MB, which is GitHub's hard per-file limit.
SplatWalk/splats/*
!SplatWalk/splats/README.md
!SplatWalk/splats/splat_quest.ply

# --- Spirula Studio ---
# A 119 MB third-party GPL binary. Too big for GitHub and not ours to
# redistribute. SplatForge points at wherever you unzipped it.
SplatForge/spirula.exe
SplatForge/spirula/
SplatForge/*.dll

# --- SplatForge scratch and results ---
SplatForge/work/
SplatForge/output/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/

# --- OS noise ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.commitmsg.txt 
SplatWalk/_tmp/ 
